requirements.text:
The following design information is intentionally not specified in this prototype system specification and shall be identified as unresolved where required to complete the system model:
• pump efficiency;
• motor efficiency;
• available net positive suction head (NPSHA);
• cooling-water temperature range;
• pump suction pressure;
• motor enclosure type;
• motor rated power;
• motor rated speed;
• motor controller type;
• shock qualification requirements;
• vibration requirements;
• acoustic/noise requirements;
• environmental temperature limits; and
• system redundancy requirements.

